FYI - OpenPrinting folks please join our PWG conference next week.

---------- Forwarded message ---------
From: Kennedy, Smith (Wireless & IPP Standards) via pwg-announce <
pwg-announce@pwg.org>
Date: Fri, Oct 30, 2020 at 7:31 AM
Subject: [PWG-Announce] PWG November 2020 Virtual Face to Face Meeting -
Nov. 3-5, 2020
To: PWG Announcements Reflector <pwg-announce@pwg.org>


Greetings,

The PWG is holding its November 2020 Virtual Face-to-Face on November 3-5,
2020. This is a "virtual" Face-to-Face event, which means the event will be
held only via Zoom teleconference. The PWG November 2020 Virtual
Face-to-Face Meeting Page
<https://www.pwg.org/chair/meeting-info/november-2020-virtual.html> provides
the event's daily agenda and teleconference information. Any and all
interested parties are invited to attend.

Cheers,
Smith

/**
    Smith Kennedy
    Chair, IEEE ISTO Printer Working Group
*/


